      <title>Google 表格喜提『最强外挂』：Gemini来了，打工人数据分析也能『躺平』了？</title>
      <link>http://192.168.50.247:1313/insights/google-gemini-20250906001004979-1/</link>
      <pubDate>Sat, 06 Sep 2025 00:10:04 +0800</pubDate>
